  "question": {
    "text": "The solution of the differential equation <math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>±</mo><msqrt><mi>λ</mi></msqrt><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math>&nbsp;(where,&nbsp;<math><mi>C</mi></math> is an arbitrary constant). Then,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>λ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;is equal to"
